<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz 1996 GDP up 5.4 pct vs 6.2-pct fall in 1995.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz 1996 GDP up 5.4 pct vs 6.2-pct fall in 1995.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 5.4 percent last year after a 6.2-percent fall in 1995, the National Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ GDP	 Jan-Dec'96    Jan-Nov'96    Jan-Dec'95</p>
<p>    pct change	    +5.4	    +6.1	    -6.2</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
